accTitle: Versioned infrastructure and independent content delivery
accDescr: One reviewed template revision produces separate shared and application stacks across environments, while a CloudFront distribution caches origin content.
V["Versioned templates + revision ID"] --> C["Review change sets"]
C --> S["Shared stack
VPC + data resources"]
C --> A["Application stack
compute + distribution"]
S -->|"exported resource references"| A
A --> D["Development / production deployments"]
A --> F["CloudFront distribution"]
U["Users"] --> F
F -->|"cache miss"| O["Application / S3 origin"]
F -->|"cache hit"| U
